msgid "Triton msdebug 使用指南"
msgstr "Triton msdebug User Guide"

msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

msgid "MindStudio Debugger（msdebug）用于调试运行在昇腾 NPU 上的设备程序，支持源码断点、单步、变量与内存查看、寄存器读取、核切换、运行状态查询和异常算子 Core Dump 解析等功能。"
msgstr "MindStudio Debugger (msdebug) debugs device programs running on the Ascend NPU. It supports setting source code breakpoints, single-stepping, viewing variables and memory, reading registers, switching cores, querying execution status, and parsing core dumps for exception operators."

msgid "msdebug 适合排查以下问题："
msgstr "msdebug is suitable for troubleshooting the following issues:"

msgid "Triton Kernel 运行结果错误；"
msgstr "The Triton kernel execution result is incorrect;"

msgid "`tl.load`、计算或 `tl.store` 阶段的数据不符合预期；"
msgstr "The data during the `tl.load`, computation, or `tl.store` phase does not match expectations;"

msgid "多 Block、多核场景中，部分核的计算结果异常；"
msgstr "In multi-block and multi-core scenarios, the computation results of some cores are abnormal;"

msgid "Kernel 运行卡住，需要确认停止位置；"
msgstr "The kernel execution is stuck, and you need to confirm the stopping location;"

msgid "NPU 发生 MTE、VEC、CUBE 等硬件异常；"
msgstr "A hardware exception such as MTE, VEC, or CUBE occurs on the NPU;"

msgid "需要分析异常现场生成的 `.core` 文件；"
msgstr "Analyze the `.core` file generated during the exception;"

msgid "源码断点、行号映射或变量调试信息异常。"
msgstr "An exception occurs in source code breakpoints, line number mapping, or variable debugging information."

msgid "msdebug 不用于调试 Triton 编译器 Pass 本身。如果程序在生成 `kernel.o` 之前已经编译失败，应使用 IR Dump、编译日志以及 GDB/LLDB 调试 `triton-opt` 或编译器进程。"
msgstr "Do not use msdebug to debug the Triton compiler pass itself. If compilation fails before `kernel.o` is generated, use IR dumps, compilation logs, and GDB/LLDB to debug `triton-opt` or the compiler process."

msgid "使用前准备"
msgstr "Preparations Before Use"

msgid "环境准备"
msgstr "Environment Preparation"

msgid "请参考 [MindStudio Debugger 安装指南](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msdebug/blob/master/docs/zh/install_guide/msdebug_install_guide.md)安装 msdebug 工具。"
msgstr "To install the msdebug tool, refer to the [MindStudio Debugger Installation Guide](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msdebug/blob/master/docs/zh/install_guide/msdebug_install_guide.md)."

msgid "若要使能 msdebug 工具，需通过以下两种方法安装 NPU 驱动固件（CANN 8.1.RC1 之后的版本且驱动为 25.0.RC1 之后的版本，推荐使用方法一）。"
msgstr "To enable the msdebug tool, you need to install the NPU driver and firmware using one of the following two methods. (For CANN versions later than 8.1.RC1 and driver versions later than 25.0.RC1, method 1 is recommended.)"

msgid "**方法一**：驱动安装时指定 `--full` 参数，然后再使用 root 用户执行 `echo 1 > /proc/debug_switch` 命令启用调试通道，msdebug 工具便可正常使用。"
msgstr "**Method 1**: Specify the `--full` parameter during driver installation, and then run the `echo 1 > /proc/debug_switch` command as the root user to enable the debug channel. The msdebug tool can then be used normally."

msgid ""
"./Ascend-hdk-<chip_type>-npu-driver_<version>_linux-<arch>.run --full\n"
msgstr ""
"./Ascend-hdk-<chip_type>-npu-driver_<version>_linux-<arch>.run --full\n"

msgid "**方法二**：驱动安装时指定 `--debug` 参数，具体安装操作请参见《CANN 软件安装指南》中的“[安装 NPU 驱动固件](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/83RC1/softwareinst/instg/instg_0005.html?Mode=PmIns&InstallType=netconda&OS=openEuler&Software=cannToolKit)”章节。"
msgstr "**Method 2**: Specify the `--debug` parameter during driver installation. For detailed installation operations, refer to the \"[Installing the NPU Driver and Firmware](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/canncommercial/83RC1/softwareinst/instg/instg_0005.html?Mode=PmIns&InstallType=netconda&OS=openEuler&Software=cannToolKit)\" chapter in the CANN Software Installation Guide."

msgid ""
"./Ascend-hdk-<chip_type>-npu-driver_<version>_linux-<arch>.run --debug\n"
msgstr ""
"./Ascend-hdk-<chip_type>-npu-driver_<version>_linux-<arch>.run --debug\n"

msgid "为 Triton Kernel 生成调试信息"
msgstr "Generate debug information for Triton Kernel"

msgid "当前 Triton-Ascend 启用 msdebug 功能需要开启以下环境变量："
msgstr "Currently, to enable the msdebug feature in Triton-Ascend, set the following environment variables:"

msgid ""
"export LLVM_EXTRACT_DI_LOCAL_VARIABLES=1\n"
"export TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO=0\n"
msgstr ""
"export LLVM_EXTRACT_DI_LOCAL_VARIABLES=1\n"
"export TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO=0\n"

msgid "环境变量"
msgstr "environment variable"

msgid "用途"
msgstr "Purpose"

msgid "`LLVM_EXTRACT_DI_LOCAL_VARIABLES=1`"
msgstr "`LLVM_EXTRACT_DI_LOCAL_VARIABLES=1`"

msgid "开启 Ascend 后端局部变量调试流程，并启用相关 Location、NOP 和行表处理"
msgstr "Starts the Ascend backend local variable debugging process and enables related Location, NOP, and line table processing."

msgid "`TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO=0`"
msgstr "`TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO=0`"

msgid "开启源码行号调试信息；当前后端默认可能关闭该信息，因此需要显式设置"
msgstr "Enable source line number debugging information; the current backend may disable this information by default, so you must set it explicitly."

msgid "当前实现中，Ascend 后端会据此向后端编译器传递 `--enable-debug-info=true` 和 `--enable-debug-variables=true`。"
msgstr "In the current implementation, the Ascend backend uses this to pass `--enable-debug-info=true` and `--enable-debug-variables=true` to the backend compiler."

msgid "约束"
msgstr "Constraints"

msgid "调试通道权限较高，不建议在生产环境长期启用；"
msgstr "The debug channel has high privileges; it is not recommended to keep it enabled for a long time in production environments;"

msgid "同一 Device 建议只启动一个 msdebug 会话，并暂停其他算子任务；"
msgstr "For the same Device, we recommend that you start only one msdebug session and pause other operator tasks;"

msgid "被调 Python 程序最好只调用一个目标 Triton Kernel；"
msgstr "The called Python program should ideally invoke only one target Triton Kernel;"

msgid "首次排查时建议关闭 Autotune，固定一组 `BLOCK_SIZE`、`num_warps` 等编译参数；"
msgstr "During initial troubleshooting, disable Autotune and fix a set of compilation options such as `BLOCK_SIZE` and `num_warps`;"

msgid "在线 msdebug 和异常算子 Dump 使用同一调试通道时可能冲突，不应同时开启；"
msgstr "Online msdebug and exception operator dump may conflict when they use the same debug channel; do not enable both at the same time;"

msgid "部分优化会改变变量生命周期，即使开启变量调试信息，也不能保证每个源码变量始终可打印；"
msgstr "Some optimizations change variable lifetimes; even if variable debugging information is enabled, it cannot be guaranteed that every source variable is always printable;"

msgid "msdebug、CANN、驱动、固件、芯片和 Triton-Ascend 需要使用相互兼容的版本。"
msgstr "msdebug, CANN, the driver, firmware, the chip, and Triton-Ascend require mutually compatible versions."

msgid "官方环境和约束说明可参考 [msdebug 使用前准备](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/mindstudio/830/ODtools/Operatordevelopmenttools/atlasopdev_16_0063.html?framework=mindspore)。"
msgstr "For the official environment and constraints, refer to [msdebug Preparation](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/mindstudio/830/ODtools/Operatordevelopmenttools/atlasopdev_16_0063.html?framework=mindspore)."

msgid "产品支持情况"
msgstr "Supported products"

msgid "官方 msdebug 当前文档列出了昇腾 A2、A3、310P 以及 950 系列等产品形态，但具体功能范围仍取决于 msdebug、驱动和 CANN 版本。"
msgstr "The current official msdebug documentation lists products such as the Ascend A2, A3, 310P, and 950 series. However, the specific functional scope still depends on the versions of msdebug, the driver, and CANN."

msgid "对于 Triton 场景，还必须确认当前 Triton-Ascend 后端支持目标芯片。可以通过编译日志、Kernel Dump 中的目标信息或 Triton 后端 Target 信息确认实际架构。"
msgstr "For Triton scenarios, you must also confirm that the current Triton-Ascend backend supports the target chip. You can confirm the actual architecture through compilation logs, target information in Kernel Dump, or Triton backend Target information."

msgid "SIMD、SIMT、AIC、AIV、Core Dump 和局部变量打印的支持范围可能不同。本文中的功能均应以本机 msdebug 的 `help` 输出和对应版本发行说明为准。"
msgstr "The support scope for SIMD, SIMT, AIC, AIV, Core Dump, and local variable printing may vary. For the features in this document, refer to the `help` output of the local msdebug and the release notes of the corresponding version."

